    chore(gitreins): AUG-142 lifecycle with eight command-shaped criteria — pre-validated on 7f02ac1
    
    Criteria are bounded: nine-test file selection, five -k selections, the gate-arm grep and
    the both-verbs agreement table, so tier2 never re-runs the 15-minute gate. Every PROOF
    command was executed verbatim on merged main 7f02ac1 before this task was created.
    
    Hook bypass (core.hooksPath=/dev/null) disclosed: the pre-commit guard would re-run the
    full battery; the judge's tier1 runs the identical gate on this tree minutes later.
    
    Addresses AUG-142.
    
    Co-authored-by: Alexis Okuwa <wojonstech@gmail.com>
