+- id: AUG-142
+  title: The opt-in semantic finding path for spec align carries evidence, uncertainty
+    and a no-write pin (AUG-142)
+  criteria:
+  - "PASS: the AUG-142 proof file collects and is green \u2014 9 tests, no skips.\n\
+    PROOF: pytest tests/test_spec_semantic_findings.py -q prints 9 passed.\nFAILIF:\
+    \ any failed or errored node, a collection error, or a summary other than 9 passed."
+  - 'PASS: a semantic contradiction is reported with every required field and the
+    false-positive control stays silent.
+
+    PROOF: pytest tests/test_spec_semantic_findings.py -q -k every_required_field
+    prints 1 passed and -k no_semantic_finding prints 1 passed, 8 deselected each.
+
+    FAILIF: either selection fails, is not collected, or reports 0 passed.'
+  - "PASS: a finding with no evidence excerpt is refused \u2014 at the constructor\
+    \ and end to end through the CLI.\nPROOF: pytest tests/test_spec_semantic_findings.py\
+    \ -q -k no_citable_text prints 1 passed and -k without_an_evidence_excerpt prints\
+    \ 1 passed.\nFAILIF: either selection fails, is not collected, or reports 0 passed."
+  - "PASS: uncertainty is mandatory and validated \u2014 a missing band or score and\
+    \ an out-of-range value are all refused.\nPROOF: pytest tests/test_spec_semantic_findings.py\
+    \ -q -k uncertainty_is_mandatory prints 1 passed.\nFAILIF: 0 passed, a collection\
+    \ error, or any failure."
+  - 'PASS: a run that emits semantic findings leaves the corpus tree byte-identical
+    (the checker cannot write).
+
+    PROOF: pytest tests/test_spec_semantic_findings.py -q -k writes_nothing prints
+    1 passed.
+
+    FAILIF: 0 passed, a collection error, or any failure.'
+  - 'PASS: a semantic finding can never carry a pass verdict and its severity is warn
+    or info only.
+
+    PROOF: pytest tests/test_spec_semantic_findings.py -q -k never_carries_a_pass_verdict
+    prints 1 passed.
+
+    FAILIF: 0 passed, a collection error, or any failure.'
+  - 'PASS: the gate pytest arm names the proof file, so the gate and CI actually execute
