+
+    PROOF: grep -c tests/test_spec_semantic_findings.py tests/gate.sh prints 1.
+
+    FAILIF: grep prints 0.'
+  - 'PASS: the new semantic fixture corpus participates in the both-verbs agreement
+    table and the shipped corpus still validates.
+
+    PROOF: pytest tests/test_spec_validators_agree.py -q prints 27 passed, and python3
